<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Listening (with Diego Gonzalez)</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Adrey</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Make It All Better</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">39izOzlpwdPB7FNrCjDJw3</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.390" end="00:19.890">This one cut deep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.800" end="00:21.390">I’m loosing some sleep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.390" end="00:24.360">You said this was a forever thing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.360" end="00:25.920">I’m sitting here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.920" end="00:30.030">All alone alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.030" end="00:33.000">You shot me like 10,000 times</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.000" end="00:36.750">Standing there my guard was down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.750" end="00:38.520">I hate you no I do love you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.520" end="00:41.790">Sometimes I don’t even know myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.790" end="00:43.290">I don’t feel heard</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.840" end="00:47.490">That’s why I wrote this song</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.490" end="00:55.490">Hoping that’ll get to you some day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.740" end="00:57.240">Are you listening?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.370" end="00:59.940">Are you really listening?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.940" end="01:01.440">All that you put me through</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.170" end="01:04.740">Can’t let you forget me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.740" end="01:06.240">Are you listening?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.040" end="01:11.370">Are you truly listening?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.370" end="01:13.230">I might be wrong but I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.230" end="01:20.460">Know you belong to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.460" end="01:21.960">I hear you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.640" end="01:27.090">Calling my name</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.090" end="01:28.590">And I wish things were the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.780" end="01:30.900">I tried to avoid it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.900" end="01:36.060">But darling there's something 'bout you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.060" end="01:40.710">And that smile that I can't ignore</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.710" end="01:42.390">Let me be the one to explain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.390" end="01:50.010">That I just need your love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.010" end="01:53.460">And I wont let go of you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.460" end="01:54.960">Are you listening?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.910" end="01:55.410">Are you really listening?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.050" end="01:56.550">All that you put me through</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.500" end="02:02.130">Can’t let you forget me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.130" end="02:03.630">Are you listening?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.490" end="02:09.000">Are you truly listening?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.000" end="02:10.860">I might be wrong but I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.860" end="02:13.260">Know that you belong to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.260" end="02:14.760">Lalala,lalala,lalala,la,lalalala</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.040" end="02:15.540">Are you listening?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.340" end="02:15.840">Are you really listening?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.760" end="02:16.260">All that you put me through</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.210" end="02:23.210">Can’t let you forget me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.860" end="02:27.360">Are you listening?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.280" end="02:27.780">Are you truly listening?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.510" end="02:29.010">I might be wrong but I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.050" end="02:29.550">Know you belong to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.680" end="02:30.180">Are you listening?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.550" end="02:31.050">Are you really listening?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.970" end="02:31.470">All that you put me through</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.420" end="02:37.380">Can’t let you forget me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.380" end="02:38.880">Are you listening?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.830" end="02:40.440">Are you truly listening?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.440" end="02:45.690">I might be wrong but I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.690" end="02:49.690">Know that you belong to me</p></div></body></tt>